1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
All of this is possible because of light.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Light consists of photons, which are elementary particles.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But there are many other elementary particles, each with different properties.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Different particles can provide different kinds of information about the universe.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
This leads to the central idea of neutrino astronomy:

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:38,000
detecting neutrinos from some of the most energetic events in the universe.
